From: @rezoss_reza <rezoss@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Guard missing Knox application policy in recent tasks

Continue through normal visible-task removal when deknox leaves the local
application policy service unavailable. Preserve its stop restriction check
when the service exists instead of propagating a NullPointerException to
SystemUI over removeAllVisibleRecentTasksExt.

diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/android/server/wm/RecentTasks.smali b/smali_classes2/com/android/server/wm/RecentTasks.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/com/android/server/wm/RecentTasks.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/android/server/wm/RecentTasks.smali
@@ -5562,6 +5562,8 @@

     check-cast v5, Lcom/samsung/android/knox/localservice/ApplicationPolicyInternal;

+    if-eqz v5, :cond_5
+
     iget v7, v2, Lcom/android/server/wm/Task;->mUserId:I

     const/4 v10, 0x0
